  "jurisdiction": "FI",
  "key": "FI/PRH/design",
  "notes": "5-year initial term, renewable in 5-year periods up to 25 years (Mallioikeuslaki \u00a724). Renewal FeeItems carry year=10 (end of first 5-year extension); consumers needing the full ladder should consult the Act. 'Yhteisrekister\u00f6intimaksu' (multi-design surcharge) emits as FeeCategory.filing; 'S\u00e4ilytysmaksu' (deposit fee) emits as FeeCategory.deferment. Community design (EUIPO) and international design (Hague) transmittal fees are also captured.",
  "office_code": "PRH",
  "retrieved_at": "2026-07-20",
  "right": "design",
  "source_url": "https://www.prh.fi/en/price-lists/hinnasto_2.html",
